 <div><h3>Can I export more than 30 days of history?</h3><p>Older records depend on Health Connect history access, platform support, and the permissions granted to Health.md. A longer date range cannot bypass those limits or recover data that the source never wrote to Health Connect.</p></div>
 <div><h3>Can I save to Obsidian or a synced folder?</h3><p>Yes, when Android&#x27;s folder picker exposes the destination and grants persistent write access. If your provider does not offer a writable folder, export locally and let your chosen sync tool move the files.</p></div>
